ied. Replace infrastructure or grow the colony.\n\n⌂\nUnchartered\n\nGive this world a lasting specialty.\n\nDevelop →\n\n+27 credits · +12 minerals · +15 science\n\nFOUNDING WORLD\n⌂\n\nA permanent Domination objective. Holding all four founding worlds wins the campaign.\n\nFounded by\nConcord\nCurrent control\nConcord\n\nMoving an administrative capital does not move this objective.\n\nCONNECTED SYSTEMS\nSundrift ↗\nAntares ↗\nCycle 24\n2423 CE\nEND CYCLE →\n↶ Undo\n10 orders remaining · 4 colonies\nCampaign restored.\nASTERION REACH / EARLY ACCESS 0.23.0\n● AUTOSAVED\nCampaign restored.",
